  "description": "This project is a sorting algorithm visualization app. Sorting alogrithms and their time complexities, efficiency, and use cases have always been interesting to me. I also really enjoy the patterns that emerge when they are visualized. I built this app to both learn React native and create a sorting visualizer that I enjoy playing around with and watch as much as I enjoyed building. App page can be acessed here: https://tasselhat.github.io/SortingAlgorithmReactApp/ (Google Chrome recommended but can be used with any browser or device)",
